\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\;[\\operatorname{LBA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\land L=L(B)]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}csl\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\;[\\operatorname{LBA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\land L=L(B)]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>文法到 LBA 只需保存长度不超过目标词的句型并猜重写；非收缩性保证成功推导不会需要更长句型。反向把模拟状态和端标记压入邻近复合变量，以免清理时缩短句型。第二式另处理长度零输入，两端标记足以区分该输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-linear-bounded-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"974813fdd45b5d4c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl","status":"resolved","id":"a941667080eb136f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-linear-bounded-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"974813fdd45b5d4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。LBA 语言和 CSL 两版本见 [[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl","status":"resolved","id":"a941667080eb136f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。LBA 语言和 CSL 